---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import EcosystemMap from "@/components/about/EcosystemMap.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Visitor Guide — NEXAH" description="Understand the NEXAH ecosystem, choose a path and know what each public place owns.">
  <header class="container page-hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Visitor Guide</p>
    <h1>Find your place in NEXAH.</h1>
    <p class="lead">NEXAH is the Orientation Ecosystem. Its public places and internal initiatives have distinct responsibilities; this guide shows where you are and where to continue.</p>
  </header>
  <section class="container section section--line" aria-labelledby="map-title">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">The public ecosystem map</p><h2 id="map-title">Four places. Four responsibilities.</h2></div>
      <p>This is the canonical Version 1 map. It contains only public responsibilities that exist today.</p>
    </div>
    <EcosystemMap />
  </section>
  <section class="container section" aria-labelledby="paths-title">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Choose by intention</p><h2 id="paths-title">What would you like to do?</h2></div></div>
    <div class="boundary-grid">
      <article class="boundary-card"><strong>I want to understand.</strong><p>Read the <a href="/library/visitors-guide/">illustrated Visitor Guide</a>, then try one session in NEXAHEDRON.</p></article>
      <article class="boundary-card"><strong>I want to research.</strong><p>Enter the <a href="/laboratory/">Laboratory</a> or continue to the NEXAH Research &amp; Framework Repository.</p></article>
      <article class="boundary-card"><strong>I want to inspect the core.</strong><p>Read the certified baseline in the ORION repository. ORION does not own Human meaning or decisions.</p></article>
      <article class="boundary-card"><strong>I want to experience it.</strong><p>Open <a href="https://nexahedron.com">NEXAHEDRON</a> with one real question. You may stop at Rest without invoking ORION.</p></article>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="container section section--line" aria-labelledby="limits-title">
    <div class="principles-panel">
      <blockquote id="limits-title">Version 1 makes orientation inspectable.<br />It does not make decisions.</blockquote>
      <div><p>The Human retains intention, meaning, acceptance and responsibility. NEXAHEDRON is a reference implementation. ORION is a deterministic certified core. Neither is an automatic authority.</p><a class="button" href="/about/">Understand the boundaries <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
